      "notes": [
        {
          "text": "Berth hire uses the indexed rates in force from 9 May 2026 (USD 0.0137 / INR 0.2165 at Indira Dock). The circular of 15 May 2026 first lists the Board-approved base rates (USD 0.0136 / INR 0.2151) and then confirms the indexed rates apply from 9 May 2026.",
          "source": {
            "document": "berth-amendment-2026-05",
            "page": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilotage and towage is entered for ships berthing in the Docks (Indira Dock and Prince's & Victoria Docks). Stream, Jawahar Dweep/Pir Pau and shifting rates in the same table are not entered.",
          "source": {
            "document": "sor-2026-05",
            "page": 9,
            "section": "2.1 (A)"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "A booking charge per vessel call (Rs. 5,455.23 foreign, Rs. 2,181.09 coastal) is adjusted against the final bill, so it is not added as a separate charge.",
